Because I know there's a collective element to the script writing.
因为我知道剧本创作是有集体参与的成分的。

988
00:38:39.540 --> 00:38:44.940
So the process is they break down the plot, and then a single writer goes and writes it.
所以流程是他们先拆解剧情，然后由一位编剧去写剧本。

989
00:38:45.040 --> 00:38:48.580
But then they bring that script back to the group, and people can pitch jokes.
但之后他们会把剧本带回给团队，大家可以提出笑话建议。

990
00:38:48.580 --> 00:38:49.660
They do joke punch-up.
他们会进行笑话润色。

991
00:38:49.740 --> 00:38:49.860
Yeah.
是的。

992
00:38:49.860 --> 00:38:51.100
They can do joke punch-up.
他们可以进行笑话润色。

