I was still like every day being like, please don't fire me.
我每天还是在想，求求你别开除我。

1057
00:42:03.400 --> 00:42:04.200
Please don't fire me.
求求你别开除我。

1058
00:42:04.200 --> 00:42:04.500
Yes.
没错。

1059
00:42:04.780 --> 00:42:05.500
Please don't fire me.
求求你别开除我。

1060
00:42:05.660 --> 00:42:06.860
We were trying to be professionals.
我们当时都在努力表现得专业。

1061
00:42:06.860 --> 00:42:07.800
We're trying to be professionals.
我们都在努力表现得专业。

1062
